#: ../../source/api/tree/balanced.rst:12 f424dd551b794aa384063e663b6c3a01
msgid ""
"This module provides self-balancing binary search tree implementations "
"that guarantee O(log n) operations by automatically maintaining balance "
"through rotations. These trees ensure efficient performance even with "
"arbitrary insertion and deletion patterns."
msgstr ""

