#: ed96b32350124c0e9f5d41381cc9780e of sds.tree.balanced.RedBlackTree:3
msgid ""
"A Red-Black tree is a BST with one extra bit per node: color (RED or "
"BLACK). The tree maintains balance using the following properties:"
